Template: homelab-mail-proxy/dovecot_backend
Type: string
Default:
Description: Backend host:port for Dovecot IMAP (e.g. dovecot01:143):
 Leave blank to skip the IMAP/IMAPS frontends entirely.

Template: homelab-mail-proxy/dovecot_backend_ssl
Type: string
Default:
Description: Backend host:port for Dovecot IMAPS (e.g. dovecot01:993):
 Leave blank to skip the IMAPS frontend.

Template: homelab-mail-proxy/postfix_backend
Type: string
Default:
Description: Backend host:port for Postfix SMTP (e.g. mail03:25):
 Leave blank to skip the SMTP frontend.

Template: homelab-mail-proxy/postfix_backend_smtps
Type: string
Default:
Description: Backend host:port for Postfix SMTPS (e.g. mail03:465):
 Leave blank to skip the SMTPS frontend.

Template: homelab-mail-proxy/postfix_backend_submission
Type: string
Default:
Description: Backend host:port for Postfix Submission (e.g. mail03:587):
 Leave blank to skip the Submission frontend.

Template: homelab-mail-proxy/enable_roundcube_listener
Type: boolean
Default: false
Description: Add the Roundcube-specific SMTPS frontend on port 10465?

Template: homelab-mail-proxy/roundcube_backend
Type: string
Default:
Description: Backend host:port for the Roundcube-specific SMTPS listener (10465):

Template: homelab-mail-proxy/rate_25
Type: string
Default: 30/30s
Description: Abuse rate limit for port 25 (connections/window):

Template: homelab-mail-proxy/rate_465
Type: string
Default: 12/30s
Description: Abuse rate limit for port 465 (connections/window):

Template: homelab-mail-proxy/rate_587
Type: string
Default: 8/30s
Description: Abuse rate limit for port 587 (connections/window):

Template: homelab-mail-proxy/rate_10465
Type: string
Default: 50/30s
Description: Abuse rate limit for port 10465 (connections/window):

Template: homelab-mail-proxy/rate_imap
Type: string
Default: 30/10s
Description: Abuse rate limit for IMAP/IMAPS ports (connections/window):
